1. To clone the public repo just run (main - branch).
    git clone "<git url>"

2. To clone the specific branch of public repo (feature - branch).
    git clone --branch <branch name> <specific branch url>

3. To clone the private repository.
    git clone <git url in that after https:// add the username@ before the github.com>
    For example ---> git clone https://JEEVANBG@github.com/JEEVANBG/PETSHOP.git